 (2).png", "id": "4807942282597640", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031505_4807942285930973_3488686570901783834_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=g-buelz_jXEQ7kNvwGTg3VZ&_nc_oc=AdrHnj4PottaxRPhxLGLblX_0KvanwqPoCzOAyLuLSIYfpv3hqNKH5-Fr0uiWU2floo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRGvt5-YvKbxNDl6HDeXgaYXScsrnZnwgz14g1XG9pQnQ&oe=6AFDAEA4"}, "display_name": "Zenith: The Last City", "keywords": ["mmorpg", "action", "adventure", "multiplayer", "social"], "long_description": "The world of Zenith crawls with monsters that have been empowered by a dark and mysterious god -- but glory and treasures await those brave enough to unveil Zenith's mysteries.\n \nExperience action-packed combat as you battle monsters that know how to dodge your blows and respond with ferocity.  Forge alliances in guilds, join epic raids and world events, and blaze a path to become the most powerful Agent Zenith has ever known. \n\nFeatures:\n- Explore an ever expanding massive open world through flying, climbing, ziplining, and even swimming!\n- Discover a deep combat system that takes both time and practice to master -- shoot, swing, and cast your way to glory.\n- Synthesize powerful items using the spoils of battle and enhance them to become a legendary Agent.\n- Discover the joy of cooking -- learn delicious recipes, gather ingredients, and share them with your friends.\n- Play together -- conquer Zenith\u2019s greatest challenges, including epic boss battles, public events and dungeons.\n\n", "short_description": "Endless adventure awaits in Zenith, an exhilarating open-world VR MMO!\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://skywave.zenithmmo.com/privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Ramen VR", "support_website_url": "https://zenithmmo.happyfox.com/", "website_url": "https://www.zenithmmo.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_ra